    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1615">

                <pb facs="1317" n="1201" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1201"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.77/112.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 7, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>What progress has been made in the Aguadulce railway project? See Department’s
                    No. 42. While the examination should be careful and thorough, it is highly
                    desirable that it proceed as rapidly as possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
